# android-app: build outputs, the 27 MB Android platform stub, and the signing key are all
# machine-local. The key is deliberately NOT published: anyone holding it could sign an APK that
# installs as an update over this one. A fresh clone simply generates its own key on first build,
# which only costs the ability to update over an existing install (uninstall + reinstall instead).
